@startuml
title 004 題組與多填空 - 組件圖

actor "老師" as Teacher
actor "學生" as Student

component "課堂介面（App 與面板）" as UI
component "WebSocket Client" as Client
component "RealtimeHub" as Hub
component "GuidedNotesService" as Notes
component "WorksheetParser" as Parser
component "BuzzerResultsService" as Answers
component "ActivityState" as Activity
component "BuzzerWinningResultsProvider" as Results
component "Google Sheets Adapter" as Sheets
cloud "Google Sheets" as Sheet

Teacher --> UI : 匯入／匯出
Student --> UI : 查看題目／提交答案
UI --> Client : 作答內容／操作
Client --> Hub : 請求與資料同步
Hub --> Notes : 匯入／匯出流程
Notes --> Parser : 辨識題號與子題佔位符
Notes --> Sheets : 讀取格值與列欄標記／單一批次寫回
Sheets --> Sheet
Hub --> Answers : 驗證完整答案組
Answers --> Activity : 題目型態與活動階段
Results --> Answers : 取得伺服器端完整勝出答案組
Notes --> Activity : 更新學習單結構與首次匯出定位紀錄
Notes --> Results : 取得活動答案結果

note right of Client
題組完整提交以 UTF-8 計算，最多 16 KiB。
超限保留答案並提示縮短。
end note

note right of Answers
2 至 20 個子答案為一次提交單位。
服務同步記錄完整提交與順位。
end note
@enduml
